# T22650 modbus - read System information. Mapping Version 5; unit 0 = system block, unit N = member N.
# Needs --var SWVER=<show system "Software version">.
step SETUP
cli show stack =~ Active Master
cli configure terminal ;; scada modbus tcp server ;; end
cli show scada modbus tcp server =~ MODBUS is enabled
cli show alarm facility settings          # CLI reference for step 5 (31 per member)
step case-literal addresses (version-1 map, record only)
read 0 0x0045 32 ASCII ~ case s8
read 0 0x0065 32 ASCII ~ case s9
read 0 0x0085 3 HEX ~ case s10
step 1 Mapping Version
read 0 0x0000 1 UINT 5
step 2 Board Name
read 1 0x0202 32 ASCII AT-IE520-28GSX member 1
read 3 0x0202 32 ASCII AT-IE520-28GSX member 3
read 4 0x0202 32 ASCII AT-IE520-28GSX member 4
step 3 Serial Number
read 1 0x0222 32 ASCII 264A23061
read 3 0x0222 32 ASCII 264A23066
read 4 0x0222 32 ASCII 264A23052
step 4 Number of Sensors
read 0 0x0047 1 UINT 15 3 members x 5
step 5 Number of Alarms
read 0 0x0048 1 UINT 4 global
read 0 0x0049 1 UINT 93 per-member: CLI 3 x 31 (reads 124 while member 2 is provisioned)
read 2 0x0120 5 RAW exc provisioned member 2 has no block
step 6 Number of Ports
read 0 0x0045 1 UINT 84 3 x 28
step 7 Number of Faults
read 0 0x0046 1 UINT 0
step 8 Software Version
read 0 0x0021 32 ASCII ${SWVER}
step 9 System Name
read 0 0x0001 32 ASCII IE520-stk
step 10 HW Mac Address
read 0 0x0041 3 HEX 0000cd370d6f virtual MAC
read 0 0x0044 1 HEX 000d member bitmap 1,3,4
step TEARDOWN
cli configure terminal ;; no scada modbus tcp server ;; end
probe 502 refused
